    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid c3e067fc-f2e7-4a67-a93e-48c1f0448469)
  )
  (text "FLDSEL  USE\n   0      data field  - EXEC & AND/TAD/ISZ/DCA & prev DEFER\n   1      inst field   - everything else\n   2      break field - BREAK\n   3      zero field  - INTAK | WRDCT | CURAD"
    (at 872.49 274.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid c4702a26-e8ce-4133-8fe0-422e1cff0e4e)
  )
  (text "save ifld and dfld when doing\n an interrupt acknowledge\nifld and dlfd get zeroed at TP2"
    (at 636.27 45.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid ce062a59-fe70-4784-af96-7cdefe7e71af)
  )
  (text "MBUF=xxx4" (at 251.46 231.14 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d9e29421-63a1-4b40-8c6c-664fbf3406d4)
  )
  (text "transfer IFLDAJ to IFLD\nFETCH of JMS/JMP opcode is old IFLD\nDEFER of JMS/JMS is with old IFLD\nEXEC of JMS is with new IFLD\n- during TP3\n  memory writeback is complete using old IFLD\n  current major state is stable\n- must be doing JMS or JMP\n- FETCH with direct addressing or DEFER"
    (at 436.88 48.26 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid dc524e9c-d913-4f28-befc-d935cb71cc8e)
  )
  (text "quickly stop sending if/df registers when ldad pressed\ndelay sending registers when ldad released\n...so we don't jam with if/df switches sent by console"
    (at 139.7 327.66 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid e0cbd5dc-e906-461a-9448-c2b84ac0a97f)
  )
